# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover role-level structural rules (folder naming, role-name regex). `meta/main.yml` presence and field checks MUST live under [`meta/`](meta/). Dependency-graph checks (self-, circular, unnecessary dependencies, `run_after`) MUST live under [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (and the sibling [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/)). Application-specific role rules (web-app README, `applications[...]` / `group_names` usage, `application_id` identity) MUST live under [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`run_once/`](run_once/). Block-level `when:` hygiene (guard blocks, duplication, size) MUST live under [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target existence MUST live under [`includes/`](includes/). Compose- or handler-specific checks MUST live in their respective topical clusters."
msgstr "Bu Kataloqda Testler MUST yalnız rol səviyyəli struktur qaydaları (qadın adı, rol-name regex). `meta/main.yml` mövcuddur və sahib yoxdur [`meta/`](meta/). Xüsusiyyət-rafik çeklər (öz-, rəsmi, qarışıqlı qarşılıqlar, `run_after`) MUST yaşayır [`meta/dependencies/`](meta/dependencies/) (qarışıq [`meta/services/run_after/`](meta/services/run_after/)). Application-based rol qaydaları (web app `applications[...]` / `group_names` istifadəçi `application_id` Qeydiyyat) MUST yaşayır [`applications/`](applications/). `run_once_<role>` flag flag s s [`run_once/`](run_once/). Block-level `when:` Bakı (gizli bloklar, duplication, ölçüsü) MUST yaşayır [`when/`](when/). `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` MUST altında yaşayır [`includes/`](includes/). kollec- və ya handler- xüsusi çeklər MUST onların müxtəlif toxumlarda yaşayır."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover rules about block-level `when:` semantics and guard-block shape. `run_once_<role>` flag lifecycle checks MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); rules about `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence MUST live under [`../includes/`](../includes/)."
msgstr "Bu Kataloqda Testler MUST yalnız blok-səviyyə haqqında qaydaları örtük `when:` semantik və gizli blok forma. `run_once_<role>` flag flag s s [`../run_once/`](../run_once/); Oxunub: `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` MUST altında yaşayır [`../includes/`](../includes/)."

