msgstr "Aksessuarlar `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` provider the `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (Ümumi `Authorization`), `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (Ümumi `Bearer {key}`, `{key}` Qırmızı)."

