# libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small ``nginx:alpine`` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Bu rol qeyd edir upstream azadlıq mərkəzi ``nginx:alpine`` image və dəstək **Dağıtım üçün çox divar**: hər giriş altında ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` bütün yapılandırılmış divarların bir link siyahısı göstərir."

