# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` eyni maşın üçün. Ətraflı Team Edition xidmətləri yerli OIDC təchizatçısı deyil, səhifə səviyyə səviyyəsi Keycloak Oxunub GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); Əvvəlki giriş növü `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, \"SSO ilə Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, Paylaşılan yardımçının adı-based giriş Matcher tanıyıb. Ətraflı v11+ ayrıca xidmət edir `/landing` yalnız bir zamanlar aydın olan unauthenticated səyahətlər üçün müasir `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` naviqasiyadan əvvəl, və paylaşılan yardımçının bunu etmək üçün bir init-script çiçək var."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same reason. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `sso.shared: false`: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` or `BIBER_PASSWORD` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` eyni səhifə. `meta/services.yml` pin `sso.enabled: false` and `sso.shared: false`: MIG, əvvəlli Meta Infinite Graph öz forması yığını üzərində təklif edir və heç bir giriş səviyyəsi, heç bir heç bir heç bir hesab, və heç bir orijinal dövrü var. Əvvəlki env faylları hesab edir `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` yaxşı `BIBER_PASSWORD` Paylaşılan yardımçılar üçün."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` in `vars/main.yml`, attached in `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` İki müxtəlif səhifə. Axtarış MinIO Konsol versiyası burada bir SSO düyməsini yoxdur - `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` Lakin, kimlik təchizatçısı qeydiyyatdan keçmiş server-side-dir - bu, paylaşılan yardım üçün OIDC giriş növü deyil. Avtomobil yalnız MinIO Sifariş yaradılması administrator RBAC qrup yolu (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` in `vars/main.yml`, əlavə `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) and MinIO heç bir self-service signup, belə bacarıq kartları heç bir siyasət və ya tier heç bir orijinal səviyyə var."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The wiki's bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` in `tasks/04_admin.yml` with `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`, backed by the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`) and not the normal-realm `ADMIN_PASSWORD` the helper types."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak onu almaq üçün SSO verir: `meta/services.yml` heç bir şey yoxdur `sso` block (the `keycloak` xidmət `provides: sso`) və pins `logout.enabled: false`, xüsusi URL ne oauth var2-proxy qapı və ya bir in-app OIDC giriş linki paytaxmaq və ya giriş. administrator şəxsi daxil olmaqdan əlavə edilir Keycloak's yalnız admin səviyyəsi daimi super-admin hesabı qeyd edir master-realm konsoludur (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`, rol-yerləşdirilmiş `credentials.administrator_password`) və normal-realm deyil `ADMIN_PASSWORD` Yardım növləri."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. E-poçt ünvanı `/sso/login` Bir yerli giriş forumu keçirən səhifə `openid-connect/auth` link, realated Roundcube səvəl birbaşa gətirir `openid-connect/logout` link; paylaşılan yardımçı oyun giriş kontrolləri əlavə edilir və iki ayrı deyil, belə logout. administrator persona ikinci, müxtəlif səviyyə üçün bloklanır: Mailu admin səviyyəsi ayrı Flask app daxildir `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), `/webmail/` OIDC səhifələrin çıxarılması."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo holds no Keycloak client, so the OIDC round-trip the shared helper waits for never happens; the administrator signs in on Matomo's native `index.php?module=Login` form against the local superuser configured in `vars/main.yml`. Biber is blocked for a different reason: the role provisions exactly one Matomo account, that same superuser, and has no per-user provisioning, so biber has no Matomo identity at all."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` pin `sso.enabled: false` - Matomo heç bir şey Keycloak müştəri, eyni zamanda OIDC turu-triptli yardımçı heç bir zaman olmaq üçün gözləyir; MatomoƏtraflı `index.php?module=Login` Yerli superuser strukturuna qarşı forma `vars/main.yml`. Avtomobil müxtəlif bir səhifə üçün bloke edilir: rol təhlükəsizlikləri Matomo hesab, eyni superuser, və hər hansı bir istifadəçi təhlükəsizlik var, belə baxmaq Matomo bütün şəkil."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle site administrator tərəfindən yaradılır `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` və hər hansı bir pass, hər ikisi `administrator` istifadəçi, beynəlxalq forma və kimlik təchizatçı bir gizli saxlamaq. SSO variantında `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` OIDC plugin üçün zövq və hər hansı bir rewrites `mdl_user` qarışıq `auth='oidc'`, O, heç bir forma ya gizli deyil; SSO-off variantları `meta/variants.yml` Heç bir OIDC zəng var. Bir env faktı rol üçün verilir, variant başına deyil, bu yüzden bayrağın pis halda tutmaq lazımdır."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX bir oauth arxasında oturur2- `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` Yalnız `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; Qarabağ ne qəbul edir, belə proxy ondan əvvəl onu inkar edir KIX bir şey vermək. Proxy KIX İki sıra giriş: SPA həmçinin öz agent formasını təklif edir `/auth` Bu LDAP qarşı qarşı qarşısını alır və paylaşılan insanın yardımçısı ikinci mövcuddur Keycloak tur-trip."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` in ``templates/env.j2``); the resulting entry point is ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, relabelled “SSO with Infinito.Nexus” by ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, which the shared helper’s name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a ``/landing`` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` eyni maşın üçün. Ətraflı Team Edition xidmətləri yerli OIDC təchizatçısı deyil, səhifə səviyyə səviyyəsi Keycloak Oxunub GitLab OAuth slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` in ``templates/env.j2``); Əvvəlki giriş növü ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``«SSO » Infinito.Nexus” ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, Paylaşılan yardımçının adı-based giriş Matcher tanıyıb. Ətraflı v11+ ayrıca xidmət edir ``/landing`` yalnız bir zamanlar aydın olan unauthenticated səyahətlər üçün müasir ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` naviqasiyadan əvvəl, və paylaşılan yardımçının bunu etmək üçün bir init-script çiçək var."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same reason. ``meta/services.yml`` pins ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``sso.shared: false``: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``, ``BIBER_USERNAME`` or ``BIBER_PASSWORD`` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` eyni səhifə. ``meta/services.yml`` pin ``sso.enabled: false`` and ``sso.shared: false``: MIG, əvvəlli Meta Infinite Graph öz forması yığını üzərində təklif edir və heç bir giriş səviyyəsi, heç bir heç bir heç bir hesab, və heç bir orijinal dövrü var. Əvvəlki env faylları hesab edir ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``, ``BIBER_USERNAME`` yaxşı ``BIBER_PASSWORD`` Paylaşılan yardımçılar üçün."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — ``/api/v1/login`` answers ``redirectRules: null`` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (``MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME`` in ``vars/main.yml``, attached in ``tasks/02_ldap.yml``) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` İki müxtəlif səhifə. Axtarış MinIO Konsol versiyası burada bir SSO düyməsini yoxdur - ``/api/v1/login`` answers ``redirectRules: null`` Lakin, kimlik təchizatçısı qeydiyyatdan keçmiş server-side-dir - bu, paylaşılan yardım üçün OIDC giriş növü deyil. Avtomobil yalnız MinIO Sifariş yaradılması administrator RBAC qrup yolu (``MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME`` in ``vars/main.yml``, əlavə ``tasks/02_ldap.yml``) and MinIO heç bir self-service signup, belə bacarıq kartları heç bir siyasət və ya tier heç bir orijinal səviyyə var."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The wiki’s bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by ``maintenance/run.php createAndPromote`` in ``tasks/04_admin.yml`` with ``MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD`` — the role-local ``credentials.administrator_password``, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in ``ADMIN_PASSWORD``. ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin`` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and ``$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName`` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: ``meta/services.yml`` carries no ``sso`` block (the ``keycloak`` service declares ``provides: sso``) and pins ``logout.enabled: false``, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak’s only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME`` / ``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` in ``vars/main.yml``, backed by the role-local ``credentials.administrator_password``) and not the normal-realm ``ADMIN_PASSWORD`` the helper types."
msgstr "Bu rol hesab ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Keycloak onu almaq üçün SSO verir: ``meta/services.yml`` heç bir şey yoxdur ``sso`` block (the ``keycloak`` xidmət ``provides: sso``) və pins ``logout.enabled: false``, xüsusi URL ne oauth var2-proxy qapı və ya bir in-app OIDC giriş linki paytaxmaq və ya giriş. administrator şəxsi daxil olmaqdan əlavə edilir KeycloakYalnız admin səviyyəsi daimi super-admin hesabı qeyd edir master-realm konsoludur (``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME`` / ``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` in ``vars/main.yml``, rol-yerləşdirilmiş ``credentials.administrator_password``) və normal-realm deyil ``ADMIN_PASSWORD`` Yardım növləri."

